.SH DESCRIPTION
.B bzip2
is provided by
.BR armybox (1),
a multi-call binary.
It is typically invoked through a symbolic link.
.PP
Block-sorting file compressor.
.PP
This is a POSIX.1-2017 utility. The armybox implementation aims for full
compliance with IEEE\ Std\ 1003.1-2017.
.PP
See
.UR https://pubs.opengroup.org/onlinepubs/9699919799/utilities/bzip2.html
POSIX specification for bzip2
.UE
for the authoritative reference.
.\"
